  "description": "<p>This round rug features a colorful feeling wheel chart, designed to help children identify and express their emotions in a fun and visual way. It serves as an emotional regulation tool, fostering mindfulness and healthy routines. Inspired by a playful composition notebook style, it adds warmth and personality to learning spaces while supporting emotional development.</p><h3>Product Highlights</h3><ul>\n<li>Colorful feeling wheel chart for emotional learning and expression.</li>\n<li>Supports emotional development and mindfulness for children.</li>\n<li>Playful composition notebook style with cheerful icons.</li>\n<li>Soft, durable, and comfortable high-quality polyester.</li>\n<li>Machine washable for easy cleaning and everyday use.</li>\n<li>Features a non-slip backing for added safety.</li>\n</ul><h3>Specifications</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Attribute</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Value</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rug Form</td>\n<td>Area Rug</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Item Shape</td>\n<td>Round</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weave Type</td>\n<td>Flat Woven</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pile Height</td>\n<td>Low Pile</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Construction Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Indoor/Outdoor Usage</td>\n<td>Indoor</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Special Features</td>\n<td>Non Slip</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pattern</td>\n<td>Cartoon</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Theme</td>\n<td>Emotional Learning</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Style</td>\n<td>Modern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Number of Pieces</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Material &amp; Care</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Item</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Detail</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material Type</td>\n<td>Faux Wool</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Backing Material</td>\n<td>Memory Foam</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Care Instructions</td>\n<td>Vacuum regularly or hand/machine wash with cold water</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Where It Works</h3><p>This versatile rug is ideal for classrooms, therapy rooms, reading corners, and calming areas. It functions as a seating mat or a classroom welcome mat, creating a supportive and emotionally aware environment for children.</p>",
